Olakunle: 437 miles * 5280 = 437*5280. Compute: 5280*400=2,112,000; *30=158,400; *7=36,960; sum = 2,307,360 ft. Speed = 132 ft/min. Time = 2,307,360 / 132. Compute: 2,307,360 ÷ 132. Let's divide: 132*10,000 = 1,320,000. Remainder 987,360. 132*7,000 = 924,000 remainder 63,360. 132*400 = 52,800 remainder 10,560. 132*80 = 10,560 remainder 0. So total = 10,000+7,000+400+80 = 17,480 minutes.

Thus Folajimi time 13,200 minutes, Olakunle 17,480 minutes. Folajimi arrives earlier. Difference = 17,480 - 13,200 = 4,280 minutes.

